<img height="283" src="img/mizubenonakama019_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/tta/mizubenonakama/img/mizubenonakama019.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/mizubenonakama020.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/mizubenonakama020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/tta/mizubenonakama/img/mizubenonakama020.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
